# Task: Improve Data Ingestion Validation

## Goal
Add stronger validation before imported market data is used by the backtesting engine.

## Relevant Context
- Architecture: claude_docs/architecture/data_flow.md
- Module spec: claude_docs/modules/data_pipeline.md
- Decision log: claude_docs/decisions/2026-04-12-backtest-design.md

## Current Problem
The ingestion pipeline accepts malformed or incomplete rows too easily, which causes downstream backtest failures.

## Requirements
- Validate required columns before processing
- Reject rows with invalid timestamps
- Log validation failures clearly
- Do not change downstream interfaces unless necessary

## Files Likely Involved
- src/data/ingestor.py
- src/backtest/data_validator.py
- tests/test_data_pipeline.py

## Done When
- malformed inputs are rejected
- tests cover failure cases
- existing valid workflows still pass